# ── 20 Sep — THE OLD SITE IS RETIRED, FOUNDER-ORDERED ────────────────────────────────────
#
# The site was rebuilt on a new design (14 pages, founder-locked). 21 pages from the old site
# survived the rebuild carrying the OLD chrome, and NOT ONE was linked from any of the 14 new
# pages. The founder's ruling: "Makes no sense to have two types of websites in one."
#
# THEY ARE REDIRECTED, NOT DELETED: CORE-MAP rule 3 is founder-locked 26 Jul — *"nothing gets
# deleted"*. Every file stays exactly where it is, so this is reversible by removing a line.
#
# 301, not 302, so search engines transfer the ranking to the page that replaced it instead
# of indefinitely re-crawling a page we retired on purpose.
#
# Each target is the nearest page that still answers the same question — NOT a blanket bounce
# to the homepage. A buyer who clicked "Pipeline Calculator" wants pricing, not a hero.
#
# THIS LIST MUST MATCH `server.js` EXACTLY. `_redirects` is a Cloudflare file and is inert on
# the Railway Express host; a page retired here alone stays fully reachable there. That gap is
# the whole of #560 and `apps/api/src/lib/website-redirects.test.ts` proves the two agree.
#
# Both the clean URL and the .html form are listed, because `extensions: ['html']` means the
# site has always answered on both and an old link or a search result may use either.

